# Every arm mkbase.py generates.  They are outputs, not sources: the builder is versioned and
# each queue rebuilds its own arms before running them, so a committed copy is a stale duplicate
# that can silently disagree with the builder it came from.  myalg_orig.py is the exception --
# it is the pinned input -- and it is matched by none of these.
